    <worksheet name='카테고리별_광고현황_m_new'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true'>| 카테고리별 현황     </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica Neue,Noto Sans,Liberation Sans,Arial,sans-serif,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Noto Color Emoji' fontsize='9'>◎ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212529' fontname='system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica Neue,Noto Sans,Liberation Sans,Arial,sans-serif,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Noto Color Emoji' fontsize='9'>노출수, 클릭수, 주문수, CTR, CVR</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica Neue,Noto Sans,Liberation Sans,Arial,sans-serif,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Noto Color Emoji' fontsize='9'> : 월간 지표 (이번달 조회시 1일~이전일 기준)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica Neue,Noto Sans,Liberation Sans,Arial,sans-serif,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Noto Color Emoji' fontsize='9'>◎ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#212529' fontname='system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica Neue,Noto Sans,Liberation Sans,Arial,sans-serif,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Noto Color Emoji' fontsize='10'>채널 컬럼명 클릭시 영업팀 &gt; 영업파트별 지표 확인 가능</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='영업실_광고실적시트_노출클릭주문수_월별' name='sqlproxy.1h9ymur0spevxd16na9a31d1u0i5' />
